{"overview":"نوامبر ۱۹۸۵: گروه مسلح M‑19 به قصر عدالت در بوگوتا حمله می‌کند و موجی از خشونت را رها می‌کند که برای همیشه کلمبیا را تغییر می‌دهد. در میان آتش‌بادهای متقابل، گروگان‌های ناامید، ارتشی بی‌وقفه و یک جنبش چریکی که آمادهٔ فدا کردن همه چیز است، کشور تماشا می‌کند که جنگ برای اولین بار قلب پایتختش را می‌پاشد. ۲۷ ساعت ترس و وحشت پس از آن، ۴۰ سال سؤال بی‌پاسخ به‌جا می‌گذارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"November 1985: The armed group, M-19, storms the Palace of Justice in Bogotá, unleashing a wave of violence that would change Colombia forever. Amid crossfire, desperate hostages, an unrelenting army, and a guerrilla movement ready to risk everything, the nation watches as war tears through the heart of its capital for the first time. The 27 hours of horror would be followed by 40 years of unanswered questions.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/zmZg7TiOO9mLIFOB8yfU8DdhjGI.jpg"}],"episodes":8,"crew":["Jayro Bustamante","Edgar Nito","Samir Olivares","Natalia Santa"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["CO"],"cast":[{"name":"Natalia Reyes","role":"Pilar Navarrete","photo":"/9N7FNKUhjtinrNPy8ANvXrB7iEr.jpg"},{"name":"Luna Baxter","role":"Olga Behar","photo":"/mS4Ca0NA07rzDHcLiJQEwH7PDiO.jpg"},{"name":"Mariana Gómez","role":"Mona","photo":"/InW3rtiA4Ch0tj55rnsl4Bo0ae.jpg"},{"name":"Robinson Díaz","role":"Belisario Betancur","photo":"/6qu272gwn8JwLmKhianszBfGadL.jpg"},{"name":"Carlos-Manuel Vesga","role":"Luis Alfonso Plazas Vega","photo":"/crm5YcUTtb5pXhZbJsATA8EAoPD.jpg"},{"name":"Santiago Alarcón","role":"Alfonso Reyes Echandía","photo":"/uT55aiEWGKaEtJiarBgDT8dWucz.jpg"},{"name":"Jose Restrepo","role":"Yesid Reyes","photo":"/vh6hQ0nG5Ib0JtjP3j2kZMAuwrl.jpg"},{"name":"Camilo Amores","role":"Jimmy Beltrán","photo":"/ojNpJ3zrsZw6NlfpppYyjWzSNmE.jpg"},{"name":"Santiago Londoño","role":"Memo","photo":""}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/297491-palacio/watch?local